  "instance_name": "ice_cream_popsicle_cultural_norm",
  "label": "Ice cream/popsicle as a cultural norm",
  "description": "The meme assumes that the viewer understands that popsicles are typically sweet, creamy, and enjoyable treats, especially for children. This cultural norm is essential to the humor, as the unexpected and unpleasant flavor (shrimp) directly contradicts this expectation. The meme relies on the viewer's familiarity with the typical taste profile of popsicles to create the comedic effect.",
